# A token created with counters on it meets both halves of Doubling Season. Sunfall exiles both Ornithopters, so it incubates 2:
# "create an Incubator token with two +1/+1 counters on it" (CR 701.53a). The Season's first ability makes it two Incubator
# tokens (CR 111.1, 614.1a), each as the effect says, and its second doubles the counters each enters with (CR 122.6, 614.1c):
# two Incubators with four +1/+1 counters each. An Incubator is an artifact, not a creature: the Season's counters are any
# permanent's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Doubling Season
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Sunfall
Plains
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
